.SH NAME
mouser\-engine\-disable \- Turn a plugin or engine off without removing it (not the mouser engine)
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmouser engine disable\fR [\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-version\fR] [\fB\-\-wait\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fINAME\fR> 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH DESCRIPTION
Turn a plugin or engine off without removing it (not the mouser engine)
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-yes\fR
Install or update without asking (the card\*(Aqs answer is yes)
.TP
\fB\-\-version\fR \fI<VERSION>\fR
The version to install (a GitHub tag or what the lock pins)
.TP
\fB\-\-wait\fR
Wait for the download to finish (the CLI always does; for scripts)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fINAME\fR>

